you want to call it...but there is this guy at the mall i work at that i've had a crush on for the past 2 yrs. So now i feel guilty for checking him out, that's just my silly mind going though. (donll anyone though)-my friends here are going crazy and losing their bars..i havent been able to talk to anyone cause no one is around when i get on here. there has been so much more but, i'm going crazy now just thinking about itoh yeah, to top things all off I still have figleafs daughters b-day presin my room waiting to be sent. Im sure now they hate me and think im a lier,but hey, at this point i dont care. I need to do laundry before i go runningaroung today.Well i hope to talk to you soon dear. Stay safe.lots of loveKarissaPs oh yeah to top it all off, yest morning before going into work, I got a flat tire...one of my new ones :(---you just gotta laugh at all this, i door atleast i try to. Ill see you soon.**copperhead**To: manfredSubj: SomethingCc: relgar, tuppence, tetsuhara, izekiel, baer, tas, amethyst, redsexy, quazarDate: Dec  3                                     ,.   '\\'\\    ,---.     Quiet, Pinky; I'm pondering.    | \\\\  l\\\\l_ //    |   Err ... right,            _              _         |  \\\\/ `/  `.|    |   Brain!  Narf!          ~\\\\   \\        /~\\       | Y |   |   ||  Y |          |  \\\\   \\      //  |       |  \\|   |   |\\ /  |   /          [   ||        ||   ]       \\   |  o|o  | >  /   /         ] Y  ||        ||  Y [       \\___\\_--_ /_/__/         |  \\_|l,------.l|_/  |       /.-\\(____) /--.\\         |   >'          `<   |       `--(______)----'         \\  (~`--____--'~\\)  /           U// U / \\          `-_>-__________-<_-'            / \\  / /|              /(_#(__)#_)\\               ( .) / / ]              \\___/__\\___/                `.`' /   [               /__`--'__\\                  |`-'    |            /\\(__,>-~~ __)                 |       |__         /\\//\\\\(  `--~~ )      